{"blocks":[["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-2169","Person/Advait Patel",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-2199","Role: Senior Site Reliability Engineer, Broadcom",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Advait Patel"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-2256","Bio: Advait Patel works on production cloud operations where background AI agents analyze logs, propose fixes, and refactor asynchronously.",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Advait Patel"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-2404","Person/Abhimanyu Anand",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-2437","Role: Senior Data Scientist, Elastic",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Abhimanyu Anand"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-2482","Bio: Abhimanyu Anand focuses on rigorous agent evaluation: hidden metric trade-offs, nondeterministic LLM judges, and significance testing for shipping decisions.",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Abhimanyu Anand"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-2653","Person/Wes McKinney",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-2683","Role: Open Source Developer; creator of pandas",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Wes McKinney"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-2738","Bio: Wes McKinney is known for pandas and the Python data stack; he speaks on parallel agent sessions, accidental vs essential complexity, and lessons from Fred Brooks in the agentic era.",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Wes McKinney"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-2934","Person/Mike Amundsen",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-2965","Role: Author and API architect",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Mike Amundsen"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3004","Bio: Mike Amundsen explores AI coaches and augmentation over raw generation, drawing on Engelbart and Licklider and patterns that strengthen human reasoning.",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Mike Amundsen"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3170","Person/Tatiana Botskina",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3204","Role: AI Researcher",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Tatiana Botskina"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3232","Bio: Tatiana Botskina works on agent-to-agent collaboration, provenance, registries, and governance for production multi-agent systems.",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Tatiana Botskina"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3376","Person/Neethu Elizabeth Simon",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3416","Role: Staff Solution Architect, Arm",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Neethu Elizabeth Simon"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3460","Bio: Neethu Elizabeth Simon helped build CI-enforced integration testing for Arm’s custom MCP server using pytest and Testcontainers.",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Neethu Elizabeth Simon"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3604","Person/Arushee Garg",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3634","Role: Senior Software Engineer, LinkedIn (Premium team)",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Arushee Garg"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3698","Bio: Arushee Garg works on supervisor-based multi-agent workflows with LangGraph for personalized jobseeker messaging at scale.",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Arushee Garg"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3834","Person/Juliette van der Laarse",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3875","Role: Engineering Manager (international financial services)",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Juliette van der Laarse"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-3944","Bio: Juliette van der Laarse presents the AI Flower, a public capability architecture for orienting teams amid shifting AI tools and practice.",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Juliette van der Laarse"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-4095","Person/Aaron Levie",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-4124","Role: Cofounder and CEO, Box",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Aaron Levie"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/People/","source-block-4161","Bio: Aaron Levie leads Box’s Intelligent Content Management direction for the agentic era, emphasizing context management, file systems as primitives, and API-first software.",["AI Codecon People 2026-03-26 Thu · 11:00–15:00 EDT","Person/Aaron Levie"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/Pt%201%20Opening%20and%20Orchestration/","source-block-0","Part 1: Opening and Orchestration",[]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/AI%20Codecon/Pt%201%20Opening%20and%20Orchestration/","source-block-38","Introduction",["Part 1: Opening and Orchestration"]],["OReilly/Event/26/03/A